<title>GREECE: GREECE CAN JOIN EMU BUT NEEDS FAST REFORMS - C.BANK.</title>
<headline>GREECE CAN JOIN EMU BUT NEEDS FAST REFORMS - C.BANK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's goal to join EMU by the year 2001 is attainable but it will require fast structural reforms in the economy to establish sustainable convergence conditions, the Bank of Greece governor said.</p>
<p>&quot;Greece's entry in the EMU by the year 2001 is attainable,&quot; Lucas Papademos told a news conference before the bank's annual shareholders' meeting.</p>
</text>
